  "definitions_zh_TW": [
    {
      "text": "→屏營",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "0264",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.停止、抑制。[例]屏息、屏氣凝神、屏住呼吸\n2.退避、隱藏。[例]屏居、屏跡\n3.排除、斥退。[例]屏除、屏棄、屏退",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "0271",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.泛指像牆的遮蔽物。[例]雀屏、畫屏　△屏風\n2.字畫裱成的條幅，通常以四幅或八幅為一組。[例]字屏、屏條",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "0496",
      "verbatim": true
    }
  ]
